959..1035 Comment "/// The left inverse\'s round trip through the forward map, at `y`: the right"
1036..1114 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip at `y` carried back along the left inverse, joined to"
1115..1191 Comment "/// the left inverse\'s round trip at `h(y)`, makes the two inverses agree at"
1192..1262 Comment "/// `y`; carried along the forward map, that agreement turns the right"
1263..1340 Comment "/// inverse\'s round trip into the left one\'s. Each map is stated as `a => b`,"
1341..1400 Comment "/// which `cong` reads as it reads `+U (a -> -F b)` (#791)."
